{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：舞台、语言与尺子","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-descriptive-set-theory","title":"为何描述集合论：给可定义集合发一张良民证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/foundations/why-descriptive-set-theory","wordCount":1565,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"polish-spaces","title":"波兰空间：可定义集合的通用坐标系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/foundations/polish-spaces","wordCount":1529,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"definable-sets","title":"可定义集合层级：把「可定义」翻译成量词层数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/foundations/definable-sets","wordCount":1613,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础-舞台-语言与尺子\">基础：舞台、语言与尺子</h1><p>在丈量集合的复杂度之前，得先把三样东西摆好：为什么值得丈量、在哪里丈量、用什么单位丈量。本章正是这三样东西。</p>\n<p>第一篇回答动机。它不急于给定义，而是先展示「不可定义」的代价——选择公理能变出勒贝格不可测的 Vitali 集、能把一个球拆成两个同样大的球（Banach–Tarski），这些病态集合共同的特征是「写不下来」。描述集合论的赌注就是：把视野收缩到能被有限逻辑运算真正构造出来的集合，病态就会消失，规矩就会回来。这一篇也交代了 Borel、勒贝格、苏斯林、卢津这条历史线索。</p>\n<p>第二篇搭建舞台。所有讨论都发生在波兰空间——可分且完备可度量化的空间。这一篇讲清楚为什么是波兰空间而不是任意拓扑空间，介绍两个反复出场的主角：贝尔空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{N}^{\\mathbb{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8452em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8452em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathbb mtight\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与康托尔空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{\\mathbb{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8452em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8452em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathbb mtight\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，以及把集合编码成「树」的技术——它是后面解析集与投影层级的共同底层表示。</p>\n<p>第三篇校准尺子。「可定义」被精确化为点类（pointclass）：从开集出发，可数并、取补、投影这三种操作各自对应逻辑上的一个量词或连接词，于是集合的复杂度就等于「定义它需要多少层量词交替」。这一篇给出贯穿全 hub 的记号系统 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma},\\boldsymbol{\\Pi},\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8805em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Π</span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，粗体（boldface）与细体（lightface）的区别，以及归约、分离、预良序这些结构性质的抽象框架——第二章的三级层级只是把这套尺子具体地摊开。</p>\n<p>本章在 hub 中是入口，不承担层级与正则性质的细节：那些概念在这里只被点到、并链接到它们的主篇。读完本章，你会拥有阅读后续全部内容所需的空间、记号与直觉。</p>\n"}